      <rules>
        <rule name="Venerable Ancient Contemptor Dreadnought" id="a290-258e-e93f-448d" hidden="false" page="103" publicationId="a716-c1c4-7b26-8424">
          <description>A Contemptor Dreadnought with this upgrade gains the Character Sub-type, the Master of the Legion and Eternal Warrior special rules and an iron halo (increasing its Invulnerable Save to 4+, but not replacing all the effects of the atomantic deflector), but may not select a Command Squad or any other unit using a variant of the Retinue special rule. In addition, it must be selected as the Warlord of an army that includes it.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
