            <profile name="Fulcrim Hand Cannon" id="e67f-453c-7cb4-82ad" hidden="false" page="161" publicationId="4934-46f7-208b-b4af" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Fulcrum hand cannon are ‘Auto’ weapons for special rules that affect such weapons, and possess multiple profiles. When making a Shooting Attack the controlling player must select either Pinpoint Strike or Empty the Chambers and makes all shooting attacks with both weapons using the same profile. In the Fight Sub-phase, the Point-blank profile must be used instead.</characteristic>
