          </infoLinks>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="a0e1-f2c4-8bcd-0723" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Decurion Sagittar" id="e647-6b50-f2ea-7336" hidden="false" page="219" publicationId="53a4-0d21-2f8a-2c45" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">This upgrade can be purchased for any one model with the Legiones Astartes (Imperial Fists) special rule, that has not been upgraded with a Pintle Mounted weapon of any kind and is part of any of the following units:
• Legion Predator Squadron
• Legion Sicaran Squadron
• Legion Sicaran Punisher Squadron
• Legion Kratos Squadron

Special Rules
A model with this upgrade gains the Decurion Sagittar special rule.

Wargear
A model with this upgrade gains a Pintle Mounted Illiastus assault cannon and an augury scanner.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Decurion Sagittar" id="ffea-b28b-86ea-e206" hidden="false" page="219" publicationId="53a4-0d21-2f8a-2c45">
              <description>When a model with this special rule makes a Shooting Attack, one Defensive weapon or Pintle Mounted weapon may make attacks targeting a different target to any other weapon the model attacks with. This should be resolved as a separate Shooting Attack, either before or after the attacks of all other weapons from that model are resolved, and cannot be used to target a unit forced to Disembark due to attacks made by the model’s other weapons. Attacks made by the single weapon chosen to attack a different target may be given the Skyfire or Precision Shots (5+) special rule at the controlling player’s choice.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="SoH Decurion Lanius" id="94dd-c8ba-d174-5c53" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <costs>
            <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="40"/>
          </costs>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditions>
                <condition childId="01b4-57c7-bf61-2abf" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="equalTo" value="0"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="SoH Decurion Lanius" id="a12a-cd0b-c070-d447" hidden="false" page="218" publicationId="53a4-0d21-2f8a-2c45" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">This upgrade can be purchased for any one model with the Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus) special rule that has not been upgraded with a Pintle Mounted weapon of any kind and is part of any of the following units:
• Legion Predator Squadron
• Legion Sicaran Squadron
• Legion Sicaran Punisher Squadron
• Legion Kratos Squadron

Special Rules
A model with this upgrade gains the Decurion Lanius special rule.

Wargear
A model with this upgrade gains a Pintle Mounted banestrike bolt cannon.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Decurion Lanius" id="42fe-420f-a144-b7e9" hidden="false" page="218" publicationId="53a4-0d21-2f8a-2c45">
              <description>All friendly models with the Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus) special rule that are within 12&quot; of any models with this special rule are considered to have a Leadership Characteristic of 9 (unless it would normally be higher) when resolving Morale checks or Pinning tests made during the Shooting phase only. If a friendly unit with the Legiones Astartes (Sons of Horus) special rule that is within 12&quot; of and within line of sight of any models with this special rule fails a Morale check or Pinning test during the Shooting phase, that unit suffers D3 Wounds against which no Saves of any kind may be taken, but Damage Mitigation rolls may be made as normal and that Morale check or Pinning test is considered to have been passed.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Banestrike Bolt Cannon" id="3bfb-69ae-691e-645c" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" page="218" publicationId="53a4-0d21-2f8a-2c45" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
